<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech cbank sets FinMin 1-wk tender, 29 pct limit.</title>
<headline>Czech cbank sets FinMin 1-wk tender, 29 pct limit.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank (CNB) on Tuesday said it would hold a one-week &quot;sell and buy&quot; tender for the Finance Ministry, with a limit rate of 29 percent.</p>
<p>It is the second consecutive day the CNB has held such an operation for the ministry, which has been short of funds due to legal limits on how much money it can raise for government operations.</p>
</text>
